5c11\u5973 \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\nPor favor, votem no Loona! \n\u0635\u0648\u062a\u0648\u0627 \u062d\u0642 \u0644\u0648\u0648\u0646\u0627\nIboto nyo po ang LOONA \ud83d\udd25\n \"vote pour loona\" \n \"Xin h\u00e3y b\u00ecnh ch\u1ecdn cho LOONA\" \ud83d\udc96\n>\u0e42\u0e2b\u0e27\u0e15\u0e43\u0e2b\u0e49 LOONA \u0e14\u0e49\u0e27\u0e22\u0e19\u0e30\u0e04\u0e30<\n\u201cTolong vote LOONA, ya!\u201d\nPor favor vota por LOONA \ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf8 \nPalun h\u00e4\u00e4letage LOONA poolt! \ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddea\nBitte stimmen Sie f\u00fcr Loona! \ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea\nVOTE NO LOONA \ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7\nVOTEZ POUR LOONA \ud83c\uddeb\ud83c\uddf7 \nGLOSUJCIE NA LOONA \n\u12a5\u1263\u12ad\u12ce\u1295 LOONA \u12f5\u121d\u133d \u12ed\u1235\u1321 \ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf9 ", "voiceComment": null, "status": 1, "createdAt": 1654101404000, "updatedAt": "2022-06-01T16:36:44.000Z", "isArtist": "Y", "name": "\uc9c4\uc194", "enName": "JinSoul", "profileImage": "https://dnkvjm1f8biz3.cloudfront.net/images/user/profile/8/1675581441_20230205161721_f.jpg", "userNickname": "", "isLike": "N", "subComments": [], "quotedComment": null, "profileImageComment": null}, {"id": 3190475, "messageId": 1425, "parentId": 0, "pollId": 0, "userId": 8, "groupId": 0, "isGroup": "N", "type": 0, "comment": "\uc804 \uc774\uc81c \uc9c4! \uc9dc! \uc790\ubcfc\uac8c\uc694", "voiceComment": null, "status": 1, "createdAt": 1654101600000, "updatedAt": "2022-06-01T16:40:00.000Z", "isArtist": "Y", "name": "\uc9c4\uc194", "enName": "JinSoul", "profileImage": "https://dnkvjm1f8biz3.cloudfront.net/images/user/profile/8/1675581441_20230205161721_f.jpg", "userNickname": "", "isLike": "N", "subComments": [], "quotedComment": null, "profileImageComment": null}, {"id": 3190520, "messageId": 1425, "parentId": 0, "pollId": 0, "userId": 8, "groupId": 0, "isGroup": "N", "type": 0, "comment": "\ub465\ub465\uc528\ub4e4\ub3c4 \uc774\ub530 \ubcf8\ubc29\uc0ac\uc218 \ud574\uc5